Date: Wed, 19 Aug 2026 15:56:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Phase 2: base 3-pane UI layout (Lipgloss)

- internal/tui: Bubbletea Model/Init/Update/View skeleton
- 3-pane layout via lipgloss.JoinHorizontal, width split 25/45/30
  as specced (paneWidths absorbs rounding drift into the right pane
  so the three always sum exactly to terminal width)
- active pane border highlighting (colorAccent vs colorMuted),
  cycled with Tab / Shift+Tab (focus-only for now; real widget
  navigation lands in Phase 3)
- left/center/right panes render placeholder content backed by the
  real composer.ComposeConfig model (empty state message when no
  services exist yet)
- right pane already calls ExportYAML() live, so the preview will
  reflect real state as soon as Phase 3 wires up editing
- main.go: entry point running the program in AltScreen mode
